{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowglift is a physics-based racing game where you control a 4 thruster vehicle. Drift and glide along the track and compete against your opponents, be they friends or AI. But beware! In this game, speed is not the only essential skill. If you're not careful with your energy, your thrusters will start losing power as you go out of bounds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126920/extras/80df2bc214345e47793fdfe9a2de52ee.poster.avif?t=1762561123\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126920/extras/80df2bc214345e47793fdfe9a2de52ee.webm?t=1762561123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126920/extras/80df2bc214345e47793fdfe9a2de52ee.mp4?t=1762561123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >intricate flight model that is easy to learn, but difficult to master</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps in 3 different environments (desert, tundra, foggy plain)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126920/extras/5ed3d8c83fc0c3a6fa0e410f4d1cc198.avif?t=1762561123\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126920/extras_big/5ed3d8c83fc0c3a6fa0e410f4d1cc198.avif?t=1762561123 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lap timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >opponent AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >controller support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >